The vulnerability is related to the lack of validation for the `MATLAB_HDR.ObjectSize` field in the MATLAB image header. The code reads the `MATLAB_HDR.ObjectSize` value without checking if it exceeds the size of the image file, which can lead to an out-of-bounds read.

